  :seon.task/plan "Found 2026-11-16 (context) [M seon_done of session/context, its agent's end: 4 stray-red, every one red on main, result/a8547af3; the judge found nothing open]. Cause, both ends read: seon.ctx.status/status's also-on-main reads base's verdicts as the var's :seon.test/status (status.clj ~308, `verdicts`), the shape before tests' (E) 2a; results are now content-identified facts on the branch read by seon.agent/results-at, so base answers none and also-on-main is empty: a red main holds is listed stray-red in the agent's own end and its page never says 'also red on main'. The judge reads main's reds from the run's own :main-red (seon.proofs/main-red over the plan's base digests and the results at them, agent.clj ~1964). PRIOR WORK: seon.proofs/main-red, seon.agent/results-at, the run answer's :main-red, status's :also-red-on-main and its :main-red input (jolt/context 2026-11-16). CHANGE: status takes main's reds where the judge does: the run's :main-red (status opts, passed by hand-back-step from its ::verdict and by the turn from its last run), else nothing claimed; also-on-main and its verdicts read go. Deletes: also-on-main's second reading of base. COST: none added: the set comes with the run. Proof, red first on production-shaped results (results-at facts, never :seon.test/status): seon.ctx.wire-test/a-red-main-holds-is-said-and-holds-nothing."
